Package: ttlcd
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: anatolijphp <anatolijphp@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: mono-runtime, libmono-system-drawing4.0-cil, libmono-system-xml4.0-cil, libmono-system-core4.0-cil, libmono-system-windows-forms4.0-cil, libmono-system-management4.0-cil, libmono-system-serviceprocess4.0-cil, libgdiplus, fonts-dejavu-core
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/anatolijphp/Thermaltake-TH240-V2-ULTRA-LCD
Description: Screen software for the Thermaltake TH240 V2 Ultra (CL-W383) LCD
 Drives the cooler's round 2.1" LCD without TT RGB Plus: a clock and sensor
 face (coolant temperature from the cooler, CPU temperature and load), an
 image, an animated GIF or a colour. Command-line tool (ttlcd) plus a systemd
 user service (systemctl --user enable --now ttlcd).
